Commit auditado: 672d984 (diff 9c3c36a..672d984)
  · implementador: b8cee2e (backend/db/migrations/0004_precios_y_costos.sql + IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md)
  · tester: bc605ea (WIP) + b1877a5 (TEST_MATRIX.md, TEST_RESULTS.md)
